      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Really the camera just needs to use a revised laser point system that the other UI already uses. This includes a much shorter interact distance and would allow for buttons to be lit up based on their active state.\n I personally dont want to be able to interact with the camera unless my controller is maybe 10cm from the device, otherwise all the interactive feedback becomes obstructive and annoying. If the camera gets too far from me I can always go into the camera menu and respawn it. when changing between avatars of different sizes this is almost always necessary anyway.\nLooks like they are getting rid of the selfie stick idea but your point is still valid for potential future features to have set distances or angles beyond what is currently available.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
